    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d272">

                <pb facs="0390" n="390" sameAs="frus:frus1861/pg390"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Brown to Mr.
                            Seward</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the
                            United States of America</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1861-06-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 12, 1861</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have had the honor to receive your
                    circular of the 6th of May, regarding the duties of the legation and consulates
                    of the United States in Turkey, with reference to passports of American citizens
                    and individuals found negotiating with this government for purposes hostile to
                    the Union.</p>
                <p>I have sent a copy of this circular to each consulate of the United States in
                    this empire, and have the honor to enclose herewith copy of the reply of the
                    present consul general for Constantinople, Mr. David P. Heap, in whose loyalty
                    to the government of the United States and fidelity to the Union I have every
                    confidence.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, with much respect, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN P. BROWN.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, United States of
                        America</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d272-a1.xml" xpointer="d272-a1"/>
